{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A first-person horror game set in a dark asylum where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382220/extras/INTRO_GIF.gif?t=1740940324\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The doctor turned his patients into test subjects for ruthless experiments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one escaped. Hiding in the dark, hunting for revenge.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And she is here too\u2026 The ghost of the woman who died in the experiments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her screams still echo, her rage never fades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do your job, or die</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deliver experimental drugs, monitor patients, and prevent escapes. Overdosing means death.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382220/extras/PATIENT_GIF.gif?t=1740940324\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The killer is hunting you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, lock doors, hide. But you can\u2019t hide forever.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382220/extras/ZOURLAS_GIF.gif?t=1740940324\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Send the recordings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown force demands the camera footage. If you refuse, you might be next.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Terror and desperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The patients rely on you. The doctor watches you. The killer hunts you. Can you survive until dawn?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382220?t=1740940324","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382220?t=1740940324","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka