AS_GIF.gif?t=1740940324\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Send the recordings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown force demands the camera footage. If you refuse, you might be next.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Terror and desperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The patients rely on you. The doctor watches you. The killer hunts you. Can you survive until dawn?</p>","developers":["For Fun Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382220/header.jpg?t=1740940324","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257087956,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087956/movie480.mp4?t=1736533140","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087956/movie_max.mp4?t=1736533140"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257087956/1ebf94c79189c9ad82b4387e40586f091a1efa5e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1736533140","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087956/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1736533140","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257087956/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1736533140"}}],"name":"OVERDOSE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti, 2 GB | or AMD Radeon equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron